    <string name="app_log_off">Before requesting account deletion, please read and confirm the following:\n\n1. Deletion is Irreversible\n1. Once deleted, your account cannot be restored.\n2. You will no longer be able to log in to this platform.\n3. All data, records, and entitlements associated with this account cannot be recovered.\n4. This action is permanent and cannot be undone. Please proceed with care.\n\n2. How Your Data Will Be Handled\nAfter deletion, your data will be processed as follows in accordance with our Terms of Service, Privacy Policy, and applicable laws:\n1. Basic account info (username, profile picture, phone number, etc.) will be deleted or anonymized.\n2. Your works, creation history, drafts, and browsing history will be deleted or de-identified.\n3. Any linked identities, verification info, and permissions will be revoked.\n4. Publicly published content may be retained in de-identified form within legal limits, solely for compliance audits, analytics, and content safety records.\n5. Certain information required by law may be retained for the legally mandated period before deletion.\n\n3. Virtual Assets &amp; Benefits\n1. All virtual assets in your account (including but not limited to membership benefits, credits, items, creation credits, and balance) will be cleared upon deletion.\n2. Virtual assets cannot be transferred, retrieved, or restored.\n3. Paid services, features, or benefits that have been purchased but not used will be forfeited.\n4. Unless otherwise required by law, refunds are not available after account deletion.\n\n4. Linked Accounts &amp; Third-Party Connections\n1. Your linked phone number and third-party accounts (e.g., WeChat, Apple) will be automatically unlinked.\n2. The deleted account identity cannot be reused.\n3. If you register again in the future, it will be treated as a new account.\n\n5. Pending Items\n1. If your account has pending orders, appeals, withdrawals, settlements, or other active transactions, we recommend completing them before proceeding.\n2. If your account is under review for violations or disputes, the platform reserves the right to delay deletion.\n\nTo confirm, tap [Request Deletion].</string>
